      "context_excerpt": "Causal AI platform Alembic helps solve one of enterprises’ biggest challenges: proving what marketing initiatives actually drive growth, not just reporting on what happened. Modeling true causation simultaneously across every channel, market and audience requires AI infrastructure that can process enormous, fast-changing datasets without reducing them to correlation-based assumptions.",
